  det_thr{0:1}=c_detect_thr[\1] det_se{0:1}=c_detect_se[\1] det_src_tx=c_detect_src_tx det_inject=c_detect_inject
  DIFF_POS>DET_DIFF_POS DIFF_NEG>DET_DIFF_NEG SE_P>DET_SE_P SE_N>DET_SE_N atb_det_vref~ATBN_detect_vref
# RX word divider (MW-11, analog/wired_rx/PINS.md: `wordclk_rx` on CKP[0], same island as the capture). The single
