  VDD_WIRE_SW~RAIL_wired_rx VSS~VSS slicer_en=c_slicer_en SL_P~SL_P SL_N~SL_N CKP{0:7}=CKP[\1] QCK>-
  D{0:3}>SLS[{0,2,4,6}] E{0:3}>SLS[{1,3,5,7}]
  trim_{d,e}{0:3}_{p0,p1,p2,n0,n1,n2,f0,f1,f2,f3}=c_slicer_trim_\1\2[{0:9}]
  vsel_e{0:3}_{0:1}=c_slicer_vsel_e\1[\2] VTAP~VTAP VTAN~VTAN VTBP~VTBP VTBN~VTBN
